        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5030 Knob With 5048 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic design of this 1-3/4\" diameter knob allows it to look beautiful in almost any setting. Concealed mounting means that the sleek look is not interrupted by unsightly screws; and because it is made by Baldwin out of solid brass, you know that it is made with attention to both style and quality. It will fit standard 2-1/8\" precut door bore holes. This knobset will fit 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5030 Classic Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" standard door preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass 1-3/4\" Diameter Classic Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.187\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button. An emergency release function allows the knob to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classic 1-3/4 Inch Diameter Knobset, Baldwin 5030",
                "description": "Baldwin Estate Collection 5030 Knob with 5048 Rose - The classic design of this 1-3/4 inch diameter knob allows it to look beautiful in almost any setting. Concealed mounting means that the sleek look is not interrupted by unsightly screws; and because it is made by Baldwin out of solid brass, you know that it is made with attention to both style and quality. It will fit standard 2-1/8 inch precut door bore holes. This knobset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-5030, Baldwin Classic knobsets, Bladwin 5030 Knobs, baldwin 5048 roses, Baldwin 5048 rosettes, solid brass knobsets, classic knobs, baldwin 5030 knobsets, baldwin estates collection, classic door knobs, bladwin 5148 rosettes,"
